  "display_title": "White Scandal",
  "description": "Fifteen years ago, Eun-Seol was accused of attempting to murder her co-star, Yi-Hyeok. Her career ended and she hasn’t known peace since, all because her mother made her take the fall for her brother so he could keep acting. In present time, Yi-Hyeok is trying to find a way to displease his grandfather in order to change his inheritance and decides to approach Eun-Seol with an offer for a fake relationship. All they have to do is be convincing… so convincing that even they may start believing it.\n\n(Source: Tapas, edited) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
